  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for Entity Framework Core — wrap every EF Core query and SaveChanges with retry, timeout and circuit-breaker via a single AddPollyResilience() call. Works with SQL Server, PostgreSQL (Npgsql), MySQL and any EF Core provider. Replaces EnableRetryOnFailure() with the full power of Polly v8 — custom exception filters, exponential backoff, hedging and chaos engineering.",
